{"id": "11241", "type": "the-resort", "slug": "building-multigenerational-generational-health", "path": "building-multigenerational-generational-health", "title": "Building Multigenerational Health", "date": "2026-08-26 09:54:09", "modified": "2026-09-10 16:08:30", "excerpt": "", "content": "<div class=\"StructuredModuleRenderer-module-scss-module__Qv95HW__structuredContent StructuredModuleRenderer-module-scss-module__Qv95HW__text\" data-testid=\"text-content\">\r\n<div>\r\n\r\nOwn your vitality. Honor your transition. Define your health at every age.\"\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"StructuredModuleRenderer-module-scss-module__Qv95HW__structuredContent StructuredModuleRenderer-module-scss-module__Qv95HW__text\" data-testid=\"text-content\">\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<strong>SUGGESTED DONATION $15. EVERY DONATION $25+ will receive a copy of Anna Maria's Book \"Healthful Cuisine\" retail value $40.</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Own your vitality. Honor your transition. Define your health at every age.\"</strong>\r\n\r\nWelcome to <strong>Building Multigenerational Health: From Fertility to Menopause</strong>—an exclusive event designed to rewrite the narrative of a woman’s life cycle. Whether you are navigating future fertility, balancing the beautiful chaos of motherhood, or stepping into the radiant wisdom of menopause, this afternoon is for you.\r\n\r\nWe are bridging cutting-edge longevity science with a supportive lifestyle community to help you program your body for lifelong vitality.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<strong>🎤 Featured Speaker: Dr. Anna Maria Clement, PhD, LN</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>• The Authority on Longevity:</strong> As the world-renowned Co-Director of Hippocrates Wellness, Dr. Anna Maria Clement is a global pioneer in lifestyle medicine and progressive nutrition.\r\n\r\n<strong>• Mastering Your Biology:</strong> Backed by over 40 years of international clinical experience, she brings the deep biochemical research needed to navigate major female milestones.\r\n\r\n<strong>• Cellular Youth:</strong> From maximizing fertility to thriving through menopause, she will show you exactly how to unlock lifelong hormonal harmony and lasting energy.\r\n\r\n<strong>👰 Hosted By: Lillianna Haas</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>• The Keeper of Life's Beginnings:</strong> Lillianna Haas is the visionary owner and operator of Truly Forever Bridal, Florida’s premier destination for celebrating family milestones.\r\n\r\n<strong>• Creating a Sanctuary:</strong> Famous for cultivating empowering environments where women feel seen and celebrated, Lillianna opens her doors to expand her mission—ensuring a woman's radiant confidence shines decades <em>after</em>she walks down the aisle.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>🎬 Produced By: Caroline Cea Bryan</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>• The Architect of the Experience:</strong> Caroline Bryan is a premier Lifestyle Medicine Expert who has collaborated with Hippocrates Wellness for nearly two decades.\r\n\r\n<strong>• Bridging Vision &amp; Action:</strong> Serving as the event’s executive producer and a Personal Health Designer, Caroline seamlessly connects clinical wellness with daily lifestyle habits to make legacy health an actionable reality.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n</div>", "seoTitle": null, "seoDesc": null, "canonical": null, "ogTitle": null, "ogDesc": null, "image": "/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03-Tampa-FL-1.png", "terms": {"resort-category": [{"name": "Events", "slug": "events"}], "event_category": [{"name": "National Lecture Tours", "slug": "national-lecture-tours"}]}, "elementor": false, "content_live": "<div data-elementor-type=\"single-post\" data-elementor-id=\"2135\" class=\"elementor elementor-2135 elementor-location-single post-11241 the-resort type-the-resort status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry resort-category-events event_category-national-lecture-tours\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dea895c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e