xt-content\">\n<div>\n<p><strong>SUGGESTED DONATION $15. EVERY DONATION $25+ will receive a copy of Anna Maria&#8217;s Book &#8220;Healthful Cuisine&#8221; retail value $40.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Own your vitality. Honor your transition. Define your health at every age.&#8221;</strong></p>\n<p>Welcome to <strong>Building Multigenerational Health: From Fertility to Menopause</strong>—an exclusive event designed to rewrite the narrative of a woman’s life cycle. Whether you are navigating future fertility, balancing the beautiful chaos of motherhood, or stepping into the radiant wisdom of menopause, this afternoon is for you.</p>\n<p>We are bridging cutting-edge longevity science with a supportive lifestyle community to help you program your body for lifelong vitality.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p><strong>🎤 Featured Speaker: Dr. Anna Maria Clement, PhD, LN</strong></p>\n<p><strong>• The Authority on Longevity:</strong> As the world-renowned Co-Director of Hippocrates Wellness, Dr. Anna Maria Clement is a global pioneer in lifestyle medicine and progressive nutrition.</p>\n<p><strong>• Mastering Your Biology:</strong> Backed by over 40 years of international clinical experience, she brings the deep biochemical research needed to navigate major female milestones.</p>\n<p><strong>• Cellular Youth:</strong> From maximizing fertility to thriving through menopause, she will show you exactly how to unlock lifelong hormonal harmony and lasting energy.</p>\n<p><strong>👰 Hosted By: Lillianna Haas</strong></p>\n<p><strong>• The Keeper of Life&#8217;s Beginnings:</strong> Lillianna Haas is the visionary owner and operator of Truly Forever Bridal, Florida’s premier destination for celebrating family milestones.</p>\n<p><strong>• Creating a Sanctuary:</strong> Famous for cultivating empowering environments where women feel seen and celebrated, Lillianna opens her doors to expand her mission—ensuring a woman&#8217;s radiant confidence shines decades <em>after</em>she walks down the aisle.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>🎬 Produced By: Caroline Cea Bryan</strong></p>\n<p><strong>• The Architect of the Experience:</strong> Caroline Bryan is a premier Lifestyle Medicine Expert who has collaborated with Hippocrates Wellness for nearly two decades.</p>\n<p><strong>• Bridging Vision &amp; Action:</strong> Serving as the event’s executive producer and a Personal Health Designer, Caroline seamlessly connects clinical wellness with daily lifestyle habits to make legacy health an actionable reality.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01bee88 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"01bee88\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/building-multigenerational-generational-health-tickets-1997639875643?aff=oddtdtcreator\" class='rsvp_btnn'>Get tickets</a>\n<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-040f509 right_col_event\" data-id=\"040f509\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bc15463 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bc15463\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Event Details</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f2e7403 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"f2e7403\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n<div class=\"el